      "correctiveNote": "Avoid this: Forgetting the bracket when subtracting f(a) and leaving −2a² − 3 instead of −2a² + 3."
    }
  ],
  "examTip": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "Put a bracket around the whole of the second function before subtracting — the sign error it prevents is the most common loss of marks in this topic."
    }
  ],
